xt\":\"正文位置\",\"autoResize\":true,\"lineHeight\":1.25},{\"id\":\"H4NqAF2i0PsgvQohdKaYf\",\"type\":\"rectangle\",\"x\":653.7887744703535,\"y\":332.2737360218364,\"width\":124.19801839192718,\"height\":30,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#a5d8ff\",\"fillStyle\":\"solid\",\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":0,\"opacity\":100,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"index\":\"aM\",\"roundness\":{\"type\":3},\"seed\":2142071151,\"version\":219,\"versionNonce\":1627548495,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"tOsVitQ6atzd90aEahaPS\"}],\"updated\":1790156206322,\"link\":null,\"locked\":false},{\"id\":\"tOsVitQ6atzd90aEahaPS\",\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":683.8877836663171,\"y\":337.2737360218364,\"width\":64,\"height\":20,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#a5d8ff\",\"fillStyle\":\"solid\",\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":0,\"opacity\":100,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"index\":\"aN\",\"roundness\":null,\"seed\":976194607,\"version\":211,\"versionNonce\":1733699951,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[],\"updated\":1790156206322,\"link\":null,\"locked\":false,\"text\":\"大纲列表\",\"fontSize\":16,\"fontFamily\":5,\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"verticalAlign\":\"middle\",\"containerId\":\"H4NqAF2i0PsgvQohdKaYf\",\"originalText\":\"大纲列表\",\"autoResize\":true,\"lineHeight\":1.25},{\"id\":\"DT93dWwI7WdpcmJlppnon\",\"type\":\"rectangle\",\"x\":577.1157601474368,\"y\":183.3629083851176,\"width\":95.04954020182291,\"height\":30,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#a5d8ff\",\"fillStyle\":\"solid\",\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":0,\"opacity\":100,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"index\":\"aO\",\"roundness\":{\"type\":3},\"seed\":547546497,\"version\":380,\"versionNonce\":1907420737,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[{\"id\":\"LlmvAJnbY3_PTxW_5MKjL\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"updated\":1790156193860,\"link\":null,\"locked\":false},{\"id\":\"LlmvAJnbY3_PTxW_5MKjL\",\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":600.6405302483483,\"y\":188.3629083851176,\"width\":48,\"height\":20,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#a5d8ff\",\"fillStyle\":\"solid\",\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":0,\"opacity\":100,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"index\":\"aP\",\"roundness\":null,\"seed\":822906209,\"version\":392,\"versionNonce\":1826324001,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[],\"updated\":1790156193860,\"link\":null,\"locked\":false,\"text\":\"工具栏\",\"fontSize\":16,\"fontFamily\":5,\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"verticalAlign\":\"middle\",\"containerId\":\"DT93dWwI7WdpcmJlppnon\",\"originalText\":\"工具栏\",\"autoResize\":true,\"lineHeight\":1.25},{\"id\":\"glRaM_JRtyIp-cmeeH0tV\",\"type\":\"ellipse\",\"x\":-7.305470592580491,\"y\":247.15695711829903,\"width\":174.39996337890625,\"height\":174.39996337890625,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#1e1e1e\",\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"fillStyle\":\"solid\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":1,\"opacity\":100,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"index\":\"aQ\",\"roundness\":{\"type\":2},\"seed\":1475509399,\"version\":191,\"versionNonce\":1925865815,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[],\"updated\":1790434303644,\"link\":null,\"locked\":false}],\"appState\":{\"viewBackgroundColor\":\"#ffffff\"},\"files\":{\"b62fd99fad3502c131eb416692ffc49d191f5dfd\":{\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"id\":\"b62fd99fad3502c131eb416692ffc49d191f5dfd\",\"dataURL\":\"data:image/png;base64,\",\"created\":1790211489275,\"lastRetrieved\":1790211489275}}}",
      "textAlignment": "center"
    },
    "type": "canvas"
  },
  {
    "children": [],
    "content": [
      {
        "styles": {},
        "text": "此画布支持编辑图形、中文和内嵌图片。悬停后可拖动左右边缘手柄调整预览大小，也可用上方图标切换左对齐、居中或右对齐。宽度与对齐会随文档保存；导出的 HTML 支持窄屏显示、离线查看和点击放大。",
        "type": "text"
      }
    ],
    "id": "canvas-demo-end",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "textColor": "default"
    },
    "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "children": [],
    "content": [
      {
        "styles": {},
        "text": "双分区",
        "type": "text"
      }
    ],
    "id": "demo-split-heading",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "isToggleable": false,
      "level": 2,
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "textColor": "default"
    },
    "type": "heading"
  },
  {
    "children": [],
    "content": [
      {
        "styles": {},
        "text": "双分区适合一边固定参考材料，一边阅读较长的说明。左侧放需要随时查看的表格或截图，右侧放分节正文；在右侧滚动时，左侧仍保持在原位，方便对照。",
        "type": "text"
      }
    ],
    "id": "demo-split-intro",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "textColor": "default"
    },
    "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "children": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "固定参考区",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-left-title",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "isToggleable": false,
              "level": 3,
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "这里可以放界面截图、核对表或其他需要反复查看的材料。试着滚动右侧说明：左侧内容会继续留在视野中。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-left-text",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": {
              "columnWidths": [
                null,
                120
              ],
              "rows": [
                {
                  "cells": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "参考材料",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "对照用途",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "界面截图",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "查看按钮位置和布局",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "操作清单",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "逐项核对插入与尺寸调整",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "关键提示",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "styles": {},
                          "text": "阅读长文时保持可见",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "props": {
                        "backgroundColor": "default",
                        "colspan": 1,
                        "rowspan": 1,
                        "textAlignment": "left",
                        "textColor": "default"
                      },
                      "type": "tableCell"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "type": "tableContent"
            },
            "id": "demo-split-table",
            "props": {
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "table"
          }
        ],
        "id": "demo-split-left",
        "props": {
          "side": "left"
        },
        "type": "splitColumn"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "长篇说明：保持参考区可见",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-right-title",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "isToggleable": false,
              "level": 3,
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "适用场景",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "a3758db9-ae81-4365-98a4-a69d8ebcbb60",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "isToggleable": false,
              "level": 4,
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "阅读操作手册时，左侧可以固定产品截图或参数表，右侧依次写背景、步骤和注意事项。读者向下浏览说明时，不必反复回到页面顶部寻找参照。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "afd99493-1d7e-409d-818a-b878a4c937be",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "同一种布局也适合需求与实现说明、原始数据与分析结论、设计稿与评审记录。让简短且需要常看的材料留在左侧，将较长、需要逐段阅读的内容放在右侧。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "77238350-b861-4b0a-a8c0-bf57dc083ab4",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "插入并编辑内容",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "24d44785-f44c-4f6a-acce-be514a3b3005",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "isToggleable": false,
              "level": 4,
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "在空白段落输入 /双分区，或打开斜杠菜单选择“双分区”。组件出现后，点击任一侧即可直接输入；也可以在两侧继续插入标题、列表、表格和图片。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "eba20e52-5e7f-467a-a33c-9f3ac1b861c9",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "建议先放置左侧参考资料，再按阅读顺序填写右侧正文。左侧材料保持精简，通常一张截图加一份小表格就足够；右侧则可以按章节写成完整的说明。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "58b7c9e6-02a6-4828-8bf0-ddd46976f8e0",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "这一侧故意保留较长的说明，以便直接试用滚动。请留意左侧的参考表：无论右侧读到哪一段，表格的位置都不会跟着改变。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-scroll-intro",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "独立滚动与尺寸",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-right-late",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "isToggleable": false,
              "level": 4,
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "继续阅读和调整",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "f550b7a0-19b2-425f-be9c-7c7bcb094b16",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "isToggleable": false,
              "level": 3,
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "把鼠标移到右侧并向下滚动，右侧内容会在自己的可视区域内移动，左侧参考区仍停留在原位。滚动到右侧顶部或底部后，继续滚动便会接上整个文档页面。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "8fa06369-1a3c-4cdc-9735-ad0801049e30",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "拖动两栏之间的分隔线，可以按内容调整宽度。左侧放表格时可适当加宽；右侧文字较多时，可把更多空间分配给正文。左右宽度会随文档保存。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "da1554e5-f5bf-4a02-932c-6383e34674cf",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "右侧可视高度有小、中、大三个预设，也可以拖动右栏下缘手柄，或直接输入像素值自定义高度。范围为 160 到 1200 像素。高度较小时更容易观察独立滚动；高度较大时适合阅读较长段落。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "6f3064df-6c27-4d94-bea4-ebf5bb39dc5c",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "两侧标题会进入文档大纲，点击右侧标题可以定位到相应段落。保存文档后，宽度、高度和两侧内容会一同保留；导出 HTML 后，读者也可以在右侧独立滚动。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "4fe0d7f6-0d00-45b1-a596-785d31e0a8e9",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "如果说明分成多个主题，可以为右侧章节添加标题。借助文档大纲，读者能快速找到后面的章节，再继续在右栏内阅读细节。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-read-tip",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "调整高度时，可以先选一个接近目标的预设，再微调到合适尺寸。右侧内容超出可视区域时会出现滚动；若内容较短，则会直接完整显示。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-height-tip",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [],
            "content": [
              {
                "styles": {},
                "text": "试着回到本节开头，再从右侧向下滚动到这里。左侧的标题和核对表始终可供对照，这正是双分区用于长篇说明的主要方式。",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "demo-split-final-tip",
            "props": {
              "backgroundColor": "default",
              "textAlignment": "left",
              "textColor": "default"
            },
            "type": "paragraph"
          }
        ],
        "id": "demo-split-right",
        "props": {
          "side": "right"
        },
        "type": "splitColumn"
      }
    ],
    "id": "demo-split",
    "props": {
      "leftWidth": 39,
      "rightHeight": 517
    },
    "type": "splitPane"
  },
  {
    "children": [],
    "content": [
      {
        "styles": {},
        "text": "多栏",
        "type": "text"
